          "offset": 1745,
          "before": "  \"scope\": \"Exact static original stack allocations, tracked pointer aliases/capacity, most recent write provenance. No arbitrary stores/offsets, heap allocations, runtime guard changes, pointer escape or new imported runtime helper.\"\n",
